{
  "museum_bench": {
    "speaker": "Bench",
    "start": [
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "hours",
            "from": 16,
            "to": 10
          }
        ],
        "node": "shut"
      },
      {
        "node": "open"
      }
    ],
    "nodes": {
      "shut": {
        "lines": [
          "A bench facing the Museum doors. A brass plate on the back: THE FRIENDS OF THE CASTLE MUSEUM, FOR THOSE WHO COME EARLY.",
          "The doors open at ten. Somebody has worn the paint off the end nearest them."
        ],
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Wait for ten",
            "actions": [
              {
                "do": "rest",
                "until": 10
              }
            ],
            "goto": "waited"
          },
          {
            "label": "Not now"
          }
        ]
      },
      "waited": {
        "lines": [
          "You sit. Nobody else comes. At ten there is a sound of bolts behind the doors, and then nothing."
        ]
      },
      "open": {
        "lines": [
          "A bench facing the Museum doors. They are open. Nobody is on the bench, and nobody has been."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "reed_fludd": {
    "speaker": "Mrs Fludd",
    "start": [
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_fludd",
            "not": true
          }
        ],
        "node": "first"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "speakerKnows",
            "news": "tuesday_asked"
          },
          {
            "if": "flag",
            "flag": "fludd_told_nurse",
            "not": true
          }
        ],
        "node": "news_nurse"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questDone",
            "quest": "one_hook_empty"
          }
        ],
        "node": "after_hook"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "questDone",
            "quest": "what_the_eels_eat"
          }
        ],
        "node": "after_eels"
      },
      {
        "when": [
          {
            "if": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_fludd",
            "eq": 1
          }
        ],
        "node": "second"
      },
      {
        "node": "third"
      }
    ],
    "nodes": {
      "first": {
        "lines": [
          "You've come over the bridge, then. Sit by it if you like. The fire's for anyone.",
          "They're down the beds till five. I keep it in so there's something to come up to."
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_fludd",
            "value": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "second": {
        "lines": [
          "Orders go on the slate. Castle still wants reed for thatch, or somebody in Castle still writes it down.",
          "Four coats on those hooks, and five names over them. I keep the fire, that's all."
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "flag",
            "flag": "talked_fludd",
            "value": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      "third": {
        "lines": [
          "The eels come up the cut at dusk, and the rats come up after the eels.",
          "Don't stand on the far bank after the bell. Nobody here does, and I've never asked them why."
        ]
      },
      "after_eels": {
        "lines": [
          "They went back into the beds this morning, first time since the spring. They didn't say much. They don't."
        ]
      },
      "after_hook": {
        "lines": [
          "Five coats. I've not seen five on those hooks since the spring.",
          "I've said nothing to them about it, and you won't either."
        ]
      },
      "news_nurse": {
        "lines": [
          "Mrs Loveday says you were asking after the nurse. Tuesdays, she was. Over the bridge after her dinner, and back before the lamps.",
          "She went past this fire on her way to the Works the once, and never came back past it. I'd have seen. I see everybody."
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "flag",
            "flag": "fludd_told_nurse",
            "value": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
